| `git add file`                | Stages file for commit         |
| `git add .`                   | Stages all files               |
| `git commit -m "msg"`         | Saves a snapshot               |
| `git status`                  | Shows repo status              |
| `git log`                     | Shows commit history           |
| `git reset file`              | Unstages a file                |
| `git branch`                  | Lists branches                 |
| `git branch name`             | Creates branch                 |
| `git checkout name`           | Switches branch                |
| `git branch --unset-upstream` | Removes remote tracking branch |

